 -(FALSETTO) Hello.

1341
00:48:06,150 --> 00:48:07,240
-You're driving me crazy.

1342
00:48:07,240 --> 00:48:08,570
-Let me go.

1343
00:48:08,570 --> 00:48:09,070
Hello.

1344
